    "description": "# RF-14 (new): Inactive Status Banner\n\n_Visual status indicator on the Referrer record page for Referrer Status = Inactive — the one status BUILD-193's automation drives with nothing shown for it yet._\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* A banner appears on the Referrer record page when Referrer Status = Inactive. Informational only — no new field stores a reason, matching BUILD-193's automation, which does not capture one.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Related: [BUILD-193 — Referrer: Inactive Status Automation](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693050810400/f/), [BUILD-235 — Referrer: Pause Button — Confirm Reason Capture](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217800997934047/f/) (Paused banner held here), [BUILD-189 — Referrer: Restriction Detail Fields](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693083539212/f/) (existing Banned banner), [BUILD-175 — Player: Ban Status + Banner](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217686087320935/f/) (precedent pattern for combining a status automation with its banner).\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* Dependencies: BUILD-193.\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer.\n* Created 2026-08-27 directly from Taryn's request. Updated 2026-08-27 to drop Paused from scope — held pending the Pause feature settling; see NOTES.\n\n",
